@flexiarg operator/say-no-code-yet-we-are-only-forming-a-plan
@title Say No Code Yet, We Are Only Forming A Plan
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-02LxGw turn-YWtiMM
@parent peripherals/read-only-first-then-extend
@context A plan is being made and coding could start.

! conclusion: Write the plan only and do no coding.

  + IF:
    The operator says no need to write code, we are just forming a plan.

  + HOWEVER:
    Code would make the plan concrete but early.

  + THEN:
    Write the plan only and do no coding.

  + BECAUSE:
    Planning is cheaper to redo than code.
